sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer client
    participant H as Order handler/DTO
    participant S as Order service
    participant R as Order repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>H: POST /orders + Idempotency-Key + items[]
    H->>H: Validate JSON, JWT and key
    H->>S: CreateOrder(user, lines, key)
    S->>R: Begin transaction; serialize user/key
    S->>R: Resolve server-side prices and reserve each product in stable ID order
    alt Existing key and matching payload
        R-->>S: Original order result
        S-->>H: Replay=true
        H-->>C: 200 OK
    else Stock conflict or write failure
        R-->>S: Error
        S->>DB: Rollback all line reservations and inserts
        S-->>H: Domain error
        H-->>C: 409 or suitable error response
    else New order
        S->>R: Insert order, item snapshots and movement audit rows
        R->>DB: Commit transaction
        S-->>H: Pending order result
        H-->>C: 201 Created
    end
    Note over DB: PostgreSQL is authoritative; Redis is never used for stock/payment state
